WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:06.244
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:19.255 --> 00:00:20.656
I am a spotted hyena.

3
00:00:22.538 --> 00:00:24.099
We are mammals that live in clans.

4
00:00:26.261 --> 00:00:27.402
Where do you live?

5
00:00:28.823 --> 00:00:29.664
We live in Africa.

6
00:00:31.532 --> 00:00:32.493
We love the savanna.

7
00:00:34.554 --> 00:00:35.915
You look like a dog.

8
00:00:37.536 --> 00:00:39.157
Spotted hyenas are more like cats.

9
00:00:40.858 --> 00:00:42.299
We run fast, and we see well.

10
00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:45.340
That makes us good hunters.

11
00:00:47.302 --> 00:00:48.342
What do you eat?

12
00:00:50.123 --> 00:00:52.585
We hunt wildebeests and antelope with our clans.

13
00:00:54.746 --> 00:00:57.408
Large clans hunt even bigger animals like rhinos.

14
00:00:59.488 --> 00:01:01.550
We also eat other animals' leftovers.

15
00:01:03.391 --> 00:01:05.173
Do you ever hunt alone?

16
00:01:06.674 --> 00:01:08.315
We hunt small prey by ourselves.

17
00:01:10.517 --> 00:01:13.119
We eat the whole animal—even their teeth!

18
00:01:16.802 --> 00:01:20.125
Spotted hyenas make lots of sounds, right?

19
00:01:21.766 --> 00:01:23.448
Yes. We can howl and wail.

20
00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:28.472
We can make a loud laughing sound too.

21
00:01:33.444 --> 00:01:35.065
Do you have any enemies?

22
00:01:36.505 --> 00:01:38.826
Well, lions and hyenas like the same food.

23
00:01:40.666 --> 00:01:42.427
Sometimes lions steal our meals.

24
00:01:44.268 --> 00:01:45.168
They also attack us.

25
00:01:45.188 --> 00:01:48.709
Oh! I see a big lion.

26
00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:51.470
I'll call my clan for help.

27
00:01:53.211 --> 00:01:56.912
Bye! Good-bye, Spotted Hyena!
